## Triage and follow-up

Keep reports with different causes in separate engineering issues even if their subjects match;
reports with different subjects can share a cause. Investigate the tenant, channel and form
before deciding. Do not treat this page as an amendment to accepted decision 0001: a change to
the desk's rule requires a new decision record.

The counts and chart are computed from the exported data. Refresh the export and reassess
before relying on them for later reports. Fixing the parser alone does not correct the form hint.

